# audit_p1 - L1 engine install log (second attempt; owner-approved; 2026-10-18)

purpose: second L1 attempt. Attempt 1 (2026-10-17) recorded no container engine
and L1 = NOT-RUN-ENVIRONMENT (prereg section 3.4; evidence file
reports/audit_p1_l1_launch.log - sealed; NOT modified by this attempt).
On 2026-10-18 the owner approved, in a guided session, enabling one OCI engine
(WSL2 distro + podman inside the distro) and executing the L1 replay per
prereg section 3.

ordering anchors:
- prereg add-commit (must predate this log): 86a32c99f9b78808f32e4e3e9ba150809264bfa2
  (2026-10-17T18:12:13+08:00; value as recorded in reports/audit_p1_l1_launch.log).
- HEAD at log creation (git rev-parse, 2026-10-18): 587c1dc9c58f027f61d9b071dc51c299ce0a152b.

## owner decision (declared before execution)
- date_local: 2026-10-18
- decision: owner selected "start now" (guided session) for item (c): install one
  OCI engine and run the L1 replay. Optional full sweep deferred (prereg section 8
  marks it optional).
- unchanged scope limit: L1 can never yield "independently verified"; at most
  "release replayed; numbers reproduced from the release's own tooling".

## capture convention
- every block below is appended by an external runner from the actual invocation:
  marker (timestamp | description), CMD line, [stdout], [stderr], EXIT code.
- nothing is retyped; failures (if any) stay in the log as recorded.
- runner script (outside the repo): C:\Users\usER\AppData\Local\Temp\opencode\audit_p1_l1_runlog.ps1
- replay transcripts go to reports/audit_p1_l1_replay_2026-10-18.log (created later).

